This project vendors two third-party data files. Neither is modified beyond the
reduction described below, and both can be regenerated from their source with
the scripts in scripts/.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Unicode Security Mechanisms (UTS #39) — confusables.txt
Source: https://www.unicode.org/Public/security/latest/confusables.txt
Copyright (c) 1991-2025 Unicode, Inc. All rights reserved.
Terms of use: https://www.unicode.org/terms_of_use.html

Vendored as: src/ctwatch/data/confusables_ascii.tsv
Regenerate with: scripts/refresh_confusables.py

The vendored file is a reduction, not a copy. It retains only mappings whose
target is a single character usable in a domain name, and only those source
characters that survive UTS #46 processing as a distinct registration. The
upstream file is approximately 700 kB; the reduction is approximately 30 kB.

