Public Suffix List
Source: https://publicsuffix.org/list/public_suffix_list.dat
Licensed under the Mozilla Public License, v. 2.0.
A copy of the MPL 2.0 is available at https://mozilla.org/MPL/2.0/.

Vendored as: src/ctwatch/data/public_suffix_list.dat
Regenerate with: scripts/refresh_public_suffix_list.py

The file is vendored verbatim. It is used to determine which part of a domain
name was registered by someone, which decides which characters the permutation
engine is allowed to mutate.
